# `vibecarbon upgrade` writes these (src/upgrade.js): .upgrade-backup is
# your pre-upgrade copy of a file it replaced, .upgrade-new is the incoming
# template content for files it left in place for manual review. Diff
# against them and delete — neither belongs in project history.
